  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AsianPeople  Movement for debt and development (APMDD) - Scaling up transparency, Accountability and Governance of Financial Flows</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Co-operation between AFRODAD,  Asian Peoples&#x2019; Movement on Debt and Development
(APMDD), Red Latinoamericana por Justicia Econ&#xf3;mica y Social (Latindadd), and European Network on Debt and Development (Eurodad). The partners will contribute to the outcomes through:  
Advocacy for improved participation of underrepresented countries in global tax collaboration mechanisms.
Civil society organisations participate in global and regional dialogues on tax and financial transparency
Strategic research on tax and development


Outcome 2) Global tax collaboration and standards reflect needs and capacities of developing countries</narrative>
  </description>
